      "section_heading_before": "",
      "question_markdown": "17. （本小题满分 15 分）已知 $a>0, b>0$，且 $2a+b=1$.\n(1) 求 $ab$ 的最大值；\n(2) 求 $\\frac{1}{a}+\\frac{2}{b}$ 的最小值；\n(3) 求 $\\frac{b^2+2a+1}{2ab}$ 的最小值.",
      "question_review": {
        "status": "reviewed_via_api2_atomic_patch",
        "source_context_ids": [
          "C003"
        ],
        "recognition_profile_version": "symbol_profile_v1",
        "lint_actions": [],
        "context_manifest": "/home/puppeteer/MathOCRClaw/benchmark/runs/20260827-163923/workflow/page14/code_outputs/match/question_contexts.json"
      },
      "handwritten_answer": {
        "text": "解：\n(1) $ab=\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 2ab\\le \\frac{1}{2}\\cdot (\\frac{2a+b}{2})^2$\n$\\because 2a+b=1$\n$\\therefore \\frac{1}{2}\\cdot (\\frac{1}{2})^2=\\frac{1}{8}$\n$\\therefore ab\\le \\frac{1}{8}$，当且仅当 $2a=b$\n即 $\\begin{cases} a=\\frac{1}{4} \\\\ b=\\frac{1}{2} \\end{cases}$ 时，等号成立.\n(2) $\\frac{1}{a}+\\frac{2}{b}=(\\frac{1}{a}+\\frac{2}{b})(2a+b)=4+\\frac{b}{a}+\\frac{4a}{b}$\n$\\frac{b}{a}+\\frac{4a}{b}\\ge 2\\sqrt{\\frac{b}{a}\\cdot \\frac{4a}{b}}=4$\n$\\therefore \\frac{1}{a}+\\frac{2}{b}=4+\\frac{b}{a}+\\frac{4a}{b}\\ge 8$，当且仅当 $\\frac{b}{a}=\\frac{4a}{b}$ 即 $\\begin{cases} a=\\frac{1}{4} \\\\ b=\\frac{1}{2} \\end{cases}$\n时，等号成立.\n(3) $\\because 2a+b=1$\n$\\therefore a=\\frac{1-b}{2}$\n$\\therefore \\frac{b^2+2a+1}{2ab}=\\frac{b^2+1-b+1}{(1-b)b}=-\\frac{b^2-b+2}{b^2-b}=-1-\\frac{2}{b^2-b}$\n$\\because b^2-b\\ge -\\frac{1}{4} \\Rightarrow -\\frac{2}{b^2-b}\\ge 8$ 当且仅当 $\\begin{cases} b=\\frac{1}{2} \\\\ a=\\frac{1}{4} \\end{cases}$ 时，\n$\\therefore \\frac{1}{b^2-b}\\le -4 \\quad \\therefore \\frac{b^2+2a+1}{2ab}=-1-\\frac{2}{b^2-b}\\ge 7$ 等号成立",
